message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Hugo Site Maintenance for Research Websites"
abstract: >-
  Maintain a Hugo site on GitHub Pages: verify the published state against the clone, audit front
  matter, alt text and internal links before publishing, and diagnose deploy runs by reading the
  annotation instead of rewriting the build.
